igga, give me my glory","columns":60,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C5","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"Nigga play with me, he ain't gon' live to tell the story","columns":56,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C5","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"You know, this the type of shit we glorify, everybody gang-gang","columns":63,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C5","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"Most of the people that you grew up with are now in the chain gang","columns":66,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C5","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"In the box, gettin' pink","columns":24,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C5","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"Niggas shittin' where you sleep","columns":31,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C5","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"Niggas shittin' whеre you eat","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C5","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"Who'da evеr knew that I'd become a fuckin' Kodak? Yeah","columns":54,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C5","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"Rap money good, but I'm still pumpin' gas through the hood","columns":58,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#maj7","column":39,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"Droppin' off plates to the fam' like Thanksgivin'","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D7","column":12,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"Got the baby snipers standin' on that murk business, yeah, slidin' for Yak","columns":75,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#6","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C5","column":36,"beat":2},{"symbol":"C#maj7","column":69,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"They ready for whatever","columns":25,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D7","column":23,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"I always knew that everything would get better","columns":46,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#6","column":17,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"lyric","text":"And it sho' got greater later","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C5","column":11,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"All the game came from the elders like hand-me-downs","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#maj7","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D7","column":38,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"Me and my brothers wearin' hand-me-downs","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#6","column":21,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"Now I'm givin' game back to the old heads","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C5","column":15,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"lyric","text":"And the respect come first, yeah, you know?","columns":43,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#maj7","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D7","column":33,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"Can't be better than the OGs, you gotta get it somewhere","columns":57,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#6","column":28,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C5","column":55,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":"Gotta come from somethin', God don't come from nothin'","columns":54,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#maj7","column":22,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"lyric","text":"We ain't seen this comin', ni**a, it's more than a blessin'","columns":59,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D7","column":1,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#6","column":29,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"lyric","text":"What you doing with Kendrick? (Ooh, ooh)","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C5","column":1,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-31","kind":"lyric","text":"What you doing with a legend? (Ooh, ooh)","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#maj7","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-32","kind":"lyric","text":"So what they call you? (Ooh, ooh)","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D7","column"